  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Rural Development Programme - visibility contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this contract is to implement as set of actions to enhance public diplomacy and the visibility of the European Union as a partner for sustainable development cooperation in Tajikistan. This effort will include organizing events, producing promotional material and enhancing the capacity of implementing partners to carry out the EU communication and visibility tasks at the highest possible standards.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
